SUMMARY:Rubik’s Cube Activity
DESCRIPTION:Traditional Chinese folk toys and games have long been enjoyed as playful ways to encourage creativity\, problem solving\, and imagination. Join us for a fun and interactive Rubik’s Cube demonstration where visitors can watch different solving techniques\, learn basic strategies\, and explore the challenge behind this classic puzzle game. \n\n\n\nGuests are also welcome to try it themselves and discover the fun of learning how to solve the cube step by step. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMeet the Community Partner:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Oregon Chinese Coalition is a local Chinese organization dedicated to building a connected and united Chinese community that embraces diverse socioeconomic backgrounds\, political beliefs\, and religious and cultural traditions.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nParking & Directions\n\n\n\nFree Lan Su Parking\n\n\n\nThere is free first come\, first served parking in our sister lot next to the garden at 424 NW Third Avenue. Additional metered parking and garages are available on surrounding streets.
URL:https://lansugarden.org/event/rubiks-cube-activity/
LOCATION:Lan Su Chinese Garden\, 239 NW Everett Street\, Portland\, Oregon\, 97209
CATEGORIES:AANHPI Heritage Month,Learning
